To reduce from left (a whole number) with right (a whole number).
If left is less than 0, set left to 0 minus left.
If right is less than 0, set right to 0 minus right.
If right is 0, set numerator to numerator divided by left, set denominator to denominator divided by left, return.
The rest is left modulo right.
Reduce from right with rest.

